'''Sophocles''' (Japanese: '''マーマネ''' ''Mamane'') is a {{TCGP|Supporter}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Celestial Guardians}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Supporter
|rule=SWSH Supporter
|effect=During this turn, attacks used by your {{TCGP|Golem|Alolan Golem}}, {{TCGP|Vikavolt}}, or {{TCGP|Togedemaru}} do +30 damage to your opponent's Active Pokémon.
}}

