==Trivia==
* {{TCG|Sophocles}} also exists in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]], but has a different effect.

===Origin===
*[[Sophocles]] is the [[Trial Captain|captain]] of [[Ula'ula Island]]'s [[Hokulani Observatory]], which is featured in the illustration.

